  "desc": "俵屋宗達筆《扇面散屏風》（東京国立博物館所蔵・重要文化財・ColBase A-12329-1）。金地・砂子散らしの屏風面に、源氏物語や伊勢物語、四季草花などを描いた扇面画を散らし貼りした六曲一双の屏風です。",
  "descen": "Pair of Six-Panel Folding Screens with Scattered Fan Paintings by Tawaraya Sotatsu (Tokyo National Museum, Important Cultural Property). Scattered fan-shaped paintings depicting classical tales and seasonal motifs across gold-dusted folding screens.",
